# Revisions that changed formatting only, and should not show up in blame.
#
# Use them:
#
#     git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# (GitHub honours this file automatically.) Add a commit here only when it
# is *purely* mechanical — `cargo fmt` and nothing else — so that ignoring
# it can never hide a real change.

# The SHA below is added *after* the reformat lands on `main`, not before:
# this repository squash-merges, so the commit hash on the PR branch is not
# the hash that ends up in history.
#
